@host = http://localhost:5135

### Ping
GET {{host}}/api/ping
Accept: application/json


### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "sergiy@example.com",
  "displayName": "Sergiy",
  "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "sergiy@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123"
}